# [Domain] Triggers Index

> Generated. Do not hand-edit. The things in `things/` are the source of truth;
> this file is a regenerable cache (see `derived-index.md`). To correct it, rebuild.

One row per active trigger across all things. Evaluated at `session-start` by the
`evaluate-triggers` prompt so trigger evaluation does not require scanning every
thing's frontmatter. A trigger is "active" if its owning thing's status is not in
{completed, cancelled}.

